msgstr "主頁僅顯示頁面數最高的前 %s 個頁面，完整列表請查看詳情頁面。"

msgid "Host - Pages - Hits - Bandwidth - Last visit date - [Start date of last visit] - [Last page of last visit]"
msgstr "主機 - 頁面數 - 點擊數 - 頻寬 - 最後訪問時間 - [最後訪問開始時間] - [最後訪問頁面]"

msgid "[Start date of last visit] and [Last page of last visit] are saved only if session is not finished"
msgstr "[最後訪問開始時間] 和 [最後訪問頁面] 僅在工作階段未結束時保存"

msgid "The first %s items are sorted by hits in descending order; order of the remaining items is undefined."
msgstr "前 %s 個項目已按點擊數從高到低排序，其餘項目的順序未定義。"

