msgid "docs.config.title"
msgstr "⚙️ AWStats 設定指令大全"

msgid "docs.config.subtitle"
msgstr "按版本和功能分類的詳細設定說明"

msgid "docs.config.note"
msgstr "每個指令都標註了引入版本，方便您根據 AWStats 版本選擇使用。"

msgid "config.full"
msgstr ""
"<h2 class='section-core'>📌 核心設定 (必需)</h2>"
""
"<!-- LogFile -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+ (v3.1+ 支援標籤)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>LogFile</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>指定要分析的日誌檔路徑</li>"
"      <li>支援絕對路徑或相對路徑</li>"
"      <li>支援動態標籤（如 %YYYY-0%MM-0%DD-0）實現按日期輪替</li>"
"      <li>支援透過管線讀取壓縮檔案（如 gzip -cd access.log.gz |）</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: /var/log/apache/access.log 或 gzip -cd /var/log/apache/access.log.gz |</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: /var/log/httpd/mylog.log</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- LogType -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.7+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>LogType</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>指定日誌檔案類型：W=網頁日誌，M=郵件日誌，F=FTP日誌</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: W</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: W</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- LogFormat -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v2.1+ (持續擴充中)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>LogFormat</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>定義日誌格式。可以使用預設值或自訂格式字串</li>"
"      <li>預設值：1=Apache combined，2=IIS W3C，3=Webstar，4=Apache common</li>"
"      <li>支援 %host、%time1、%methodurl 等標籤</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: 1 或 \"%host %other %logname %time1 %methodurl %code %bytesd %refererquot %uaquot\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 1</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- LogSeparator -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>LogSeparator</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>自訂日誌欄位分隔符號</li>"
"      <li>當使用預設格式(1,2,3,4)時此參數無效</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \" \" 或 \"\\t\" 或 \"|\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: \" \"</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DNSLookup -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+ (v5.0+ 支援值2)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DNSLookup</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否啟用反向DNS查詢</li>"
"      <li>0=停用，1=完全啟用，2=僅從靜態DNS快取查詢</li>"
"      <li>啟用會大幅降低處理速度（40-100倍），建議大型網站停用或使用geoip外掛替代</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 2</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DynamicDNSLookup -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v7.5+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DynamicDNSLookup</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>動態DNS解析，僅在產生報表時解析主機名，而不是在日誌分析階段</li>"
"      <li>0=停用，1=啟用，2=啟用並包含靜態DNS快取</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DirData -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DirData</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>AWStats 資料庫檔案的儲存目錄</li>"
"      <li>如果要從瀏覽器更新統計，需要確保Web伺服器使用者有寫入權限</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: /var/lib/awstats 或 ../data</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: .</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DirCgi -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DirCgi</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>awstats.pl 的 Web 訪問路徑</li>"
"      <li>用於命令列產生靜態報表時產生正確的連結</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: /awstats</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: /cgi-bin</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DirIcons -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DirIcons</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>圖示檔案的 Web 訪問路徑</li>"
"      <li>靜態報表中，需設定為相對於輸出目錄的路徑</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: /awstatsicons 或 ../icon</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: /icon</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- SiteDomain -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v3.2+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>SiteDomain</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>網站的主網域</li>"
"      <li>用於多虛擬主機時過濾記錄，以及產生完整URL連結</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: www.domain.com 或 myintranetserver</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 空</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- HostAliases -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+ (v5.6+ 支援正規表示式)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>HostAliases</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>網站的其他可能網域名稱或別名，用於識別來源URL是否為站內連結</li>"
"      <li>支援正規表示式</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \"www.myserver.com localhost 127.0.0.1 REGEX[\\.mydomain\\.(net|org)$]\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: \"localhost 127.0.0.1 REGEX[^.*\\.myserver\\.com$]\"</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- AllowToUpdateStatsFromBrowser -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v3.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>AllowToUpdateStatsFromBrowser</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否允許從瀏覽器觸發統計更新</li>"
"      <li>啟用時需要確保資料目錄對Web伺服器使用者可寫</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- AllowFullYearView -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.9+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>AllowFullYearView</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否允許檢視全年統計</li>"
"      <li>0=從不允許</li>"
"      <li>1=僅命令列允許（下拉框不顯示）</li>"
"      <li>2=僅命令列允許（下拉框顯示但停用）</li>"
"      <li>3=命令列和CGI均允許</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 2</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<h2 class='section-optional'>🔧 可選功能增強</h2>"
""
"<!-- EnableLockForUpdate -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>EnableLockForUpdate</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>更新時是否使用鎖檔案防止並發</li>"
"      <li>啟用可避免衝突和DoS攻擊</li>"
"      <li>行程被殺時需手動刪除鎖檔案</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DNSStaticCacheFile -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DNSStaticCacheFile</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>靜態DNS快取檔案路徑</li>"
"      <li>檔案格式：'時間戳 IP位址 解析主機名' 或 'IP位址 解析主機名'</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: /mydnscachedir/dnscache.txt</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: dnscache.txt</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DNSLastUpdateCacheFile -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DNSLastUpdateCacheFile</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>動態DNS快取檔案路徑</li>"
"      <li>每次更新後重新產生，與靜態快取配合使用</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: dnscachelastupdate.txt</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- SkipDNSLookupFor -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v3.0+ (v5.6+ 支援正規表示式)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>SkipDNSLookupFor</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>指定不需要進行DNS查詢的IP位址或範圍</li>"
"      <li>支援正規表示式</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \"127.0.0.1 REGEX[^192\\.168\\.]\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 空</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- AllowAccessFromWebToAuthenticatedUsersOnly -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v4.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>AllowAccessFromWebToAuthenticatedUsersOnly</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否僅允許認證使用者透過Web訪問統計</li>"
"      <li>需要配合Web伺服器的認證機制使用</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- AllowAccessFromWebToFollowingAuthenticatedUsers -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v4.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>AllowAccessFromWebToFollowingAuthenticatedUsers</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>允許透過Web訪問統計的認證使用者清單</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \"user1 user2\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 空</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- AllowAccessFromWebToFollowingIPAddresses -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v5.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>AllowAccessFromWebToFollowingIPAddresses</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>允許透過Web訪問統計的IP位址或範圍</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \"127.0.0.1 123.123.123.1-123.123.123.255\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 空</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- CreateDirDataIfNotExists -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v4.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>CreateDirDataIfNotExists</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>如果資料目錄不存在，是否自動建立</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 1</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- BuildHistoryFormat -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v6.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>BuildHistoryFormat</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>歷史資料庫的儲存格式</li>"
"      <li>text=文字格式，xml=XML格式（體積大3倍）</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: text</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- BuildReportFormat -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v6.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>BuildReportFormat</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>報表輸出格式</li>"
"      <li>html=HTML格式，xhtml=XHTML格式</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: html</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- SaveDatabaseFilesWithPermissionsForEveryone -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v4.0+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>SaveDatabaseFilesWithPermissionsForEveryone</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否將資料庫檔案儲存為所有人可讀寫</li>"
"      <li>解決命令列使用者和Web伺服器使用者權限衝突</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- PurgeLogFile -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v2.23+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>PurgeLogFile</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>分析後是否清空日誌檔</li>"
"      <li>注意：IIS不支援此功能</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- ArchiveLogRecords -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v2.1+ (v6.4+ 支援標籤後綴)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>ArchiveLogRecords</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否歸檔已處理的日誌記錄</li>"
"      <li>僅在 PurgeLogFile=1 時有效</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: 1 或 %YYYY%MM%DD</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- KeepBackupOfHistoricFiles -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v3.2+</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>KeepBackupOfHistoricFiles</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>是否保留歷史檔案的備份（.bak）</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: 0</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- DefaultFile -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+ (v5.0+ 支援多個值)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
"  <div class='config-content'>"
"    <div class='config-name'>DefaultFile</div>"
"    <ul>"
"      <li>預設首頁檔案名稱</li>"
"    </ul>"
"    <div class='config-example'>例: \"index.php index.html default.html\"</div>"
"    <div class='config-default'>預設: index.html</div>"
"  </div>"
"</div>"
""
"<!-- SkipHosts -->"
"<div class='config-item'>"
"  <div class='config-version'>v1.0+ (v5.6+ 支援正規表示式)</div>"
"  <div class='config-marker'></div>"
